    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d111">

                <pb facs="0228" n="132" xml:id="pg132"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-05-26"><hi rendition="#italic">May 26,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>If required for safety of legation, confer with admiral about sending guards for
                    your protection.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
